    "ja": "国宝級令息の求婚"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Possessing everything from looks to personality, family background, abilities, and talent, Hilarion Svarov is the object of admiration for the people. The King is trying to push forward a marriage proposal between the Princess and Hilarion as his son-in-law. However, knowing that the Princess has a lover, Hilarion decides to quickly find a marriage partner for himself so that the marriage proposal can be called off. Hilarion's strangely specific preferences lead him to find a young lady, Teryl Kuljet, whom he has been pursuing and pining for. However, Teryl is hiding a secret that she cannot tell anyone... A spectacular love fantasy that transcends fate, featuring a national treasure-worthy son who is devotedly in love and a young lady with a secret!"
  },
